{"id":"1bad781655752e9f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-totalrec.md","title":"全递归函数","display":"df-totalrec — 全递归函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-totalrec","aliases":["20-df-totalrec"],"display":"df-totalrec — 全递归函数","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 17.2.4；全函数限制（本地定义）","source_pdf_pages":[260],"source_printed_pages":[233],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pr]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-totalrec"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-totalrec</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-totalrec — 全递归函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 17.2.4；全函数限制（本地定义）"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>260</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>233</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" href=\"?note=a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" title=\"20-df-pr\">20-df-pr</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}=\\mathrm{PR}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}=\\mathrm{PR}_1\\)</span> 见上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" href=\"?note=a197f5a4c2eb61dc\" title=\"20-df-pr\">20-df-pr</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}totalrec}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalRecursive}:=\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PR}:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TotalRecursive}_k:=\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}totalrec}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalRecursive}:=\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PR}:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TotalRecursive}_k:=\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>与全可计算函数的相等是模型等价定理的内容，见本目录 ct-equiv。局部保留旧 TotalRecursive 记号，统一去掉混用的 TotalRec 和 TotalRecursive 的签名漂移。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 17.2.4；全函数限制（本地定义）；印刷页 233；PDF 第 260 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pr","status":"resolved","id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pr]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pr","status":"resolved","id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pr]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}=\\mathrm{PR}_1","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}totalrec}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalRecursive}:=\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PR}:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TotalRecursive}_k:=\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1143,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-totalrec]] — 章 17；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-totalrec]]"}],"outgoing":["a197f5a4c2eb61dc"]}